cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the exact archived version when available. This working archive has no release DOI yet."
title: "Expert Iteration: Experiments and Lessons"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Towell
    given-names: Alexander Richard
    email: lex@metafunctor.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6443-9897"
    affiliation: Southern Illinois University Edwardsville
repository-code: "https://github.com/queelius/expert-iteration"
abstract: >-
  A research archive and teaching resource on search-assisted policy learning
  and frozen-language-model orchestration. Includes local examples, selected
  historical outcomes, offline metric reconstruction, and bounded negative
  findings. Not a claim of a novel successful controller or a completed
  off-policy reinforcement-learning efficiency study.
keywords:
  - expert iteration
  - reinforcement learning
  - Monte Carlo tree search
  - language model orchestration
  - negative results
  - reproducibility
